/*
# Scrinit — Fix profiles and re-seed all data with new user IDs

The demo users were recreated through the admin API (proper auth.identities),
but the profiles have default values and all dependent data (screenplays,
assignments, sessions, feedback) was cascaded on delete. This migration:
1. Updates profiles with correct metadata
2. Re-inserts all screenplays, assignments, sessions, feedback, and requests
   using the new user IDs.
*/

-- ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
-- Step 1: Fix profiles with correct metadata
-- ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
